1
00:00:00,740 --> 00:00:02,370
(Penny:)Okay, that is the lamest excuse

2
00:00:02,375 --> 00:00:04,905
(Penny:)you could've possibly
come up with.

3
00:00:06,279 --> 00:00:07,609
(Penny:)But I get it.

4
00:00:07,614 --> 00:00:08,784
(Leonard:)You do?

5
00:00:08,782 --> 00:00:10,252
(Penny:)Yeah.

6
00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:11,650
(Penny:)Sometimes I worry
you're gonna wake up

7
00:00:11,651 --> 00:00:13,921
(Penny:)and leave me
for someone more like you.

8
00:00:15,221 --> 00:00:18,091
(Leonard:)I don't even understand
why you're with someone like me.

9
00:00:18,091 --> 00:00:21,091
(Leonard:)Why would I want to be
with someone like me?

10
00:00:21,094 --> 00:00:22,694
(Penny:)You know what I mean.

11
00:00:22,695 --> 00:00:25,095
(Penny:)And, you know, maybe the way
I've been reacting

12
00:00:25,098 --> 00:00:28,798
(Penny:)was me sabotaging this, too.

13
00:00:28,802 --> 00:00:31,802
(sighs)
Well, how about we stop

14
00:00:31,805 --> 00:00:34,605
(Leonard:)being so scared
of losing each other

15
00:00:34,607 --> 00:00:36,137
(Leonard:)and just be together?

16
00:00:36,142 --> 00:00:38,872
(Penny:)That sounds nice.

17
00:00:38,878 --> 00:00:39,878
(Amy:)Good.

18
00:00:39,879 --> 00:00:41,249
(both chuckle)

19
00:00:41,247 --> 00:00:42,817
(Amy:)Because...

20
00:00:42,816 --> 00:00:45,016
(Leonard:)I've loved you
since the moment we met,

21
00:00:45,018 --> 00:00:48,188
(Leonard:)and I will keep loving you
until the end of time.

22
00:00:48,188 --> 00:00:49,588
(Leonard:)Oh.

23
00:00:49,589 --> 00:00:51,589
(Penny:)Oh, my God,
that is the most beautiful thing

24
00:00:51,591 --> 00:00:53,961
(Penny:)anyone's ever said to me.
Yeah?

25
00:00:53,960 --> 00:00:57,100
(Leonard:)That's because you're beautiful,

26
00:00:57,097 --> 00:01:03,027
(Leonard:)and your beauty fills my heart
with love and song.

